@startuml diagram
title 검색 화면 - Core / Domain / Data 클래스 다이어그램

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

package Core {

  abstract class "Result<TData, TError>" as Result <<record>> {
    -Result()
  }

  class "Success<TData, TError>" as ResultSuccess <<record>> {
    +data : TData {readonly}
  }

  class "Error<TData, TError>" as ResultError <<record>> {
    +error : TError {readonly}
  }
  note bottom of ResultError
    Success/Error는 Result<TData, TError>의
    중첩(nested) sealed record.
    private 생성자로 외부에서 직접 상속 불가,
    두 케이스만 존재하는 Discriminated Union.
  end note

  ResultSuccess --|> Result : 상속 (성공 케이스)
  ResultError --|> Result : 상속 (실패 케이스)

  class "PagedResult<T>" as PagedResult {
    +PagedResult(items: IReadOnlyList<T>, hasMore: bool)
    +Items : IReadOnlyList<T> {readonly}
    +HasMore : bool {readonly}
  }

  enum NetworkError {
    NetworkTimeout
    NoInternet
    NotFound
    ServerError
    Unknown
  }
}

package Domain {

  class ImageItem {
    +ImageItem(id: string, thumbnailUrl: string, tags: IReadOnlyList<string>, authorName: string)
    +Id : string {readonly}
    +ThumbnailUrl : string {readonly}
    +Tags : IReadOnlyList<string> {readonly}
    +AuthorName : string {readonly}
  }

  class SearchQuery {
    +SearchQuery(keyword: string)
    +Keyword : string {readonly}
  }
  note right of SearchQuery
    keyword가 빈 문자열/공백뿐이면
    생성자에서 ArgumentException
    (리뷰 항목: 프로젝트의 "실패는 Result" 규칙과
    불일치 — 이번 반영 범위 밖이라 유지함)
  end note

  interface IImageSearchRepository {
    +SearchAsync(query: SearchQuery, page: int, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<Result<PagedResult<ImageItem>, NetworkError>>
  }

  interface IThumbnailRepository {
    +GetAsync(url: string, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<Result<byte[], NetworkError>>
  }
  note bottom of IThumbnailRepository
    두 인터페이스 공통 계약:
    취소는 Result.Error가 아니라
    OperationCanceledException으로 전파된다.
  end note
}

package Data {

  class PixabaySearchResponseDto {
    +totalHits : int
    +total : int
    +hits : List<PixabayHitDto>
  }

  class PixabayHitDto {
    +id : long
    +tags : string
    +previewURL : string
    +webformatURL : string
    +user : string
    +likes : int
    +views : int
  }

  PixabaySearchResponseDto *-- PixabayHitDto : 포함 (hits 목록)

  interface IPixabaySearchDataSource {
    +SearchAsync(keyword: string, page: int, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<PixabaySearchResponseDto>
  }
  note top of IPixabaySearchDataSource
    실패 시 예외:
    - NetworkTimeoutException (내부 타임아웃)
    - NetworkUnavailableException (연결 불가)
    - PixabayApiException(statusCode) (비-2xx 응답)
    - OperationCanceledException (호출자 취소, 그대로 전파)
    그 외 알 수 없는 예외는 그대로 던짐
  end note

  interface IThumbnailDataSource {
    +DownloadAsync(url: string, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<byte[]>
  }
  note bottom of IThumbnailDataSource
    IPixabaySearchDataSource와 동일한
    예외 계약을 따른다.
  end note

  class UnityWebRequestSearchDataSource {
    +SearchAsync(keyword: string, page: int, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<PixabaySearchResponseDto>
  }
  class UnityWebRequestThumbnailDataSource {
    +DownloadAsync(url: string, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<byte[]>
  }

  UnityWebRequestSearchDataSource ..|> IPixabaySearchDataSource : 구현
  UnityWebRequestThumbnailDataSource ..|> IThumbnailDataSource : 구현
  UnityWebRequestSearchDataSource ..> PixabaySearchResponseDto : 의존 (JSON 역직렬화 결과)

  class ImageItemMapper {
    +{static} ToModel(dto: PixabayHitDto) : ImageItem
    -{static} ParseTags(raw: string) : IReadOnlyList<string>
  }
  note bottom of ImageItemMapper
    ParseTags: "a, b, c" 형태의 문자열을
    콤마로 split 후 각 항목 trim하여
    빈 항목은 제거한 목록으로 변환
  end note

  ImageItemMapper ..> PixabayHitDto : 의존 (변환 입력)
  ImageItemMapper ..> ImageItem : 의존 (변환 결과)

  class PixabaySearchRepository {
    -dataSource : IPixabaySearchDataSource
    +PixabaySearchRepository(dataSource: IPixabaySearchDataSource)
    +SearchAsync(query: SearchQuery, page: int, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<Result<PagedResult<ImageItem>, NetworkError>>
  }
  note bottom of PixabaySearchRepository
    DataSource 호출 → ImageItemMapper로 변환 →
    예외를 NetworkError로 매핑해 Result.Error 생성,
    성공 시 Result.Success(PagedResult) 생성.
    OperationCanceledException은 매핑하지 않고 재전파.
  end note

  class ThumbnailRepository {
    -dataSource : IThumbnailDataSource
    +ThumbnailRepository(dataSource: IThumbnailDataSource)
    +GetAsync(url: string, cancellationToken: CancellationToken) : UniTask<Result<byte[], NetworkError>>
  }

  PixabaySearchRepository ..|> IImageSearchRepository : 구현
  ThumbnailRepository ..|> IThumbnailRepository : 구현

  PixabaySearchRepository ..> IPixabaySearchDataSource : 의존 (생성자 주입, DIP)
  PixabaySearchRepository ..> ImageItemMapper : 의존
  PixabaySearchRepository ..> ImageItem : 의존 (매핑 결과 조립)
  PixabaySearchRepository ..> PagedResult : 의존 (Core)
  PixabaySearchRepository ..> Result : 의존 (Core)
  PixabaySearchRepository ..> NetworkError : 의존 (Core, 예외 매핑 결과)

  ThumbnailRepository ..> IThumbnailDataSource : 의존 (생성자 주입, DIP)
  ThumbnailRepository ..> Result : 의존 (Core)
  ThumbnailRepository ..> NetworkError : 의존 (Core, 예외 매핑 결과)
}

' ---- Domain -> Core 의존 ----

IImageSearchRepository ..> SearchQuery : 의존 (검색 조건 파라미터)
IImageSearchRepository ..> ImageItem : 의존 (검색 결과 항목)
IImageSearchRepository ..> Result : 의존 (성공/실패 래핑)
IImageSearchRepository ..> PagedResult : 포함 (페이지 결과가 ImageItem 목록을 담음)
IImageSearchRepository ..> NetworkError : 의존 (실패 사유)

IThumbnailRepository ..> Result : 의존 (성공/실패 래핑)
IThumbnailRepository ..> NetworkError : 의존 (실패 사유)

note "Service 계층은 이번 화면에서는 불필요하다고 판단되어 생략함\n(단일 Repository 호출만 필요, 조합 로직 없음)" as N1

@enduml
